%h1{ class: "text-2xl font-bold" } Organization invite
%p{ class: "mt-2 text-ink" }
  Share this code with someone you want to join
  %span{ class: "font-semibold" }= current_user.organization.name
  as a member.

- if @invite_code
  .invite-code{ class: "mt-4 inline-block rounded border border-line bg-surface p-4 text-2xl font-mono tracking-widest text-ink" }
    = @invite_code.code
- else
  %p{ class: "mt-4 text-inkMuted" } No invite code yet.

= form_with url: organization_invite_code_path, class: "mt-6" do |form|
  = form.submit "Generate invite code", class: "inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-signal px-5.5 py-3 font-data text-caption font-medium tracking-caption text-onSignal"